{"version":1,"content":"<p>科學家正嘗試藉助行星和死亡恆星，尋找宇宙中最神秘物質——暗物質的蹤跡。儘管暗物質被認為約佔宇宙全部物質的85%，人類至今仍未直接觀測到它，其本質也仍是未解之謎。研究人員目前主要依據其引力效應推斷暗物質的存在，但對其構成仍知之甚少。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587910.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:23:55.422332+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T06:11:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T06:17:14.180336+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:17:14.180336+00:00","content_hash":"e48bf1d1e89a58b943e2bb3b81350c7590675094bdf04e51ae383254ef2b8f8f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}